66:  panel.innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">A romance written in the stars</div><h1 class="panel-title">Every great story<br>starts with a choice.</h1><p class="lead">A strange new world. Three unforgettable hearts. And a story that bends around the person you choose to be.</p>
