77:  <div class="creator-foot"><div class="mini-avatar">${avatarSvg()}</div><span>Your look is part of the story. You can change it any time before you begin.</span></div>
78:  <button class="button-primary" id="begin">STEP INTO THE STORY <span>→</span></button></div>`;
